workflow.step:


      Set {{new_status}} = "Done"
      Set {{review_outcome}} = "Approved"


      Set {{new_status}} = "In Progress"
      Set {{review_outcome}} = "Changes Requested"



    Build structured review comment:
    ```
    ## Code Review ({{date}})

    **Outcome:** {{review_outcome}}

    ### Findings
    {{#each finding}}
    **[{{severity}}]** {{description}}
    {{#if file}}File: {{file}}:{{line}}{{/if}}
    {{/each}}

    ### Summary
    - Issues Found: {{high_count}} High, {{medium_count}} Medium, {{low_count}} Low
    - Issues Fixed: {{fixed_count}}
    - Action Items: {{action_count}}

    {{#if review_outcome == "Approved"}}
    ✅ All acceptance criteria verified. Story complete.
    {{else}}
    ⚠️ Address findings before marking complete.
    {{/if}}
    ```

    Post review comment to Linear:
      mcp__linear__create_comment with issueId={{linear_issue_id}}, body={{review_comment}}



    Update Linear issue state:
      mcp__linear__update_issue with id={{linear_issue_id}}, state={{new_status}}



      ✅ **Code Review Complete - Story Approved!**

Linear issue {{linear_issue_id}} updated to Done.
Review findings posted as comment.




      🔄 **Code Review Complete - Changes Requested**

Linear issue {{linear_issue_id}} updated to In Progress.
Review findings posted as comment.

**Next Steps:**
1. Address the {{action_count}} action items
2. Run `dev-story` to continue implementation
3. Run `code-review` again when ready



    **✅ Review Complete!**

**Story Status:** {{new_status}}
**Issues Fixed:** {{fixed_count}}
**Action Items Posted:** {{action_count}}

Review findings have been posted to the Linear issue as a comment.
